OL,3,W"###"###"###T//////,,/-,/-,/-.-.,//////
OL,4,CBurst pipe shuts schools and disrupts  
OL,5,Csupplies                               
OL,6,GThree schools have closed and water    
OL,7,Gsupplies to homes and businesses are   
OL,8,Gbeing disrupted after a water main     
OL,9,Gburst in Sherborne.                    
OL,11,FThe burst is affecting the DT9         
OL,12,Fpostcode area, causing low water       
OL,13,Fpressure or no supply. Wessex Water    
OL,14,Fhas apologised and said teams were on  
OL,15,Fsite carrying out urgent repairs.      
OL,17,FThe firm added it was trying to move   
OL,18,Fwater around the network to keep as    
OL,19,Fmany homes connected as possible and   
OL,20,Fwould be in touch with those           
OL,21,Fregistered on its priority service to  
OL,22,Fdeliver bottled water if needed.  G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
