OL,4,CHeat network project being explored by 
OL,5,Ccouncil                                
OL,6,GA multi-million-pound project aimed at 
OL,7,Gmaking heating cheaper and more        
OL,8,Gefficient for people across Reading    
OL,9,Gcould be used as an innovative         
OL,10,Gsolution for the town.                 
OL,12,FReading Borough Council has been       
OL,13,Finvestigating the possibility of       
OL,14,Fcreating a heat network for the town   
OL,15,Ffor years.                             
OL,17,FMost properties have their own         
OL,18,Findividual heating systems, typically  
OL,19,Fusing a gas boiler, but alternatives   
OL,20,Flike air source heat pumps are being   
OL,21,Fincreasingly used.                     
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
