OL,4,CEducation pioneer gets blue plaque on  
OL,5,Cformer home                            
OL,6,GA woman believed to be the first       
OL,7,Gfemale professor appointed by a        
OL,8,GBritish university has been celebrated 
OL,9,Gwith a blue plaque installed on her    
OL,10,Gformer home.                           
OL,12,FEdith Morley played a central role in  
OL,13,Fthe development of University College  
OL,14,FReading, which became the town's       
OL,15,Funiversity, and became a professor in  
OL,16,FEnglish language there in 1908.        
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
